          "canonical_heading": "IMAGING",
          "content_blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Intra-articular and periarticular joint structures—",
              "pdf_page": 1088,
              "printed_page": 1006,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Radiography of affected limbs—irregular degenerate owing to abnormal conformation of flattening of the metaphysis; stippled the appendicular skeleton; leads to altered appearance of epiphyses; widening of the biomechanics; results in poor quality of life. physeal line; retained endochondral cores; irregularities in ossification of the affected long bone; degenerative joint disease and joint laxity owing to abnormal stress and",
              "pdf_page": 1088,
              "printed_page": 1006,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "weightbearing on the limbs.",
              "pdf_page": 1088,
              "printed_page": 1006,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Radiography of",
              "pdf_page": 1088,
              "printed_page": 1006,
              "column": 2
            }
          ]
        },
